---
title: RaceCar - Virtual Motorsports Team
---

.intro
  .intro-body
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-md-8
          p = image_tag 'logos/rc-logo-2020-inv.svg', style: 'width: 100px'
          p = image_tag 'logos/25y.svg', style: 'width: 100px'
          h1.brand-heading RaceCar
          p.intro-text  Virtual Motorsports Team since 2001
          a.btn.btn-circle.page-scroll href="#aboutus"
            i.fa.fa-angle-double-down.animated

/! About
section#aboutus
  .container.content-section.text-center
    .celebration
      .row
        .col.text-center
          h2 RaceCar's 25th anniversary
      .row
        .col-lg-4.offset-lg-4
          p 
            | Running in the 2001 
            a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20050322171635/http://www.gp3dl.de.vu/" GP3DL
            |  Daniel and Felix formed RaceCar as it is today. 
            strong Happy 25 years to us!
            br
            a href="https://www.unmedial.de/2026/01/19/geschichte-eines-gemalde/" Read more
        .col.align-self-end.col-lg-4
          = image_tag '25y-daniel-felix.jpg', alt: 'Felix and Daniel celebrate. Between them a painted picture of the RC-09, their first race car.'

    .row.justify-content-center
      .col-md-8
        h2.d-block About us
        p RaceCar is a non-commercial virtual motorsports team. It has been active in many Simracing leagues over 20 years with various racing simulations.
        ul.list-inline.banner-social-buttons
          li.d-inline
            a.btn.btnghost.btn-lg href="https://www.facebook.com/racecarf1/"
              span.network-name Facebook
          li.d-inline
            a.btn.btnghost.btn-lg href="https://www.thesimgrid.com/teams/12674-racecar/grid_feed"
              span.network-name Simgrid
          li.d-inline
            a.btn.btnghost.btn-lg href="https://pitskill.io/team/986f4192-d551-4e44-af7c-e29f9ed68650"
              span.network-name Pitskill

